WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.299
Sam: Lucky! Want to go for a

2
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.805
walk? What's wrong, buddy? Are you tired?

3
00:00:15.806 --> 00:00:19.076
Okay. You can stay home. Mom:

4
00:00:19.077 --> 00:00:21.068
Where's Lucky?

5
00:00:21.069 --> 00:00:23.124
Sam: He didn't want to come.

6
00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:25.746
I think something's wrong. Mom:

7
00:00:25.747 --> 00:00:28.098
He seemed fine this morning.

8
00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:29.948
He chewed up the TV remote. And

9
00:00:29.949 --> 00:00:35.498
Dad's slippers again! Max: What

10
00:00:35.499 --> 00:00:39.740
are you going to buy at the One Dollar Shop? Sam:

11
00:00:39.741 --> 00:00:42.801
I have five dollars from the tooth fairy.

12
00:00:42.802 --> 00:00:46.203
I might buy a baseball or Super Chicken cards. Tia:

13
00:00:46.204 --> 00:00:54.966
