17
00:01:04.811 --> 00:01:11.945
Max: Thanks, Tia!

18
00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:15.607
Mom: Are you going to buy new Super Chicken

19
00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:18.266
cards? Sam: Maybe . .

20
00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:23.633
. Hey! I know what to

21
00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:31.662
get! A treat for Lucky!

